{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOO MANY BOTS</strong> is an experimental first-person action roguelike, a twisted test of survival inside retro-styled arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No upgrades. No permanent progress. Only your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, choose a map and enter the experiment. Rules twist, roles flip, and the bots never stop. You\u2019re prey one moment, hunter the next, caught in an endless cycle where adaptation is your only weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed run increases the game speed, so mastering the mechanics is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.poster.avif?t=1758285186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.webm?t=1758285186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.mp4?t=1758285186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill challenge with no metaprogression, only your ability to adapt and improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new game modes, each with unique rules and objectives that rewrite how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle endlessly between prey and hunter as the power balance shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore retro-PSX maps, each with its own atmosphere and hidden pulse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive endless swarms of bots, always there, always looming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect temporary power-ups to boost your survival just a little longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run ramps up the game speed, pushing your reflexes to the limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.poster.avif?t=1758285186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.webm?t=1758285186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.mp4?t=1758285186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too Many Bots will not explain itself. Each mode is a puzzle you must solve under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt. Survive. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015860?t=1758285186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015860?t=1758285186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/15003bcda0bb9fec2e6d10a83d3a3ef007e2ebcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758285186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/15003bcda0bb9fec2e6d10a83d3a3ef007e2ebcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758285186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"cont