arms of bots, always there, always looming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect temporary power-ups to boost your survival just a little longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run ramps up the game speed, pushing your reflexes to the limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.poster.avif?t=1758285186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.webm?t=1758285186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.mp4?t=1758285186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too Many Bots will not explain itself. Each mode is a puzzle you must solve under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt. Survive. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["VinegarIsSlow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/1ae7e1f68cfc4863c50a2029391dfeb0af7f7b15/header.jpg?t=1758285186","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193990,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193990/movie480.mp4?t=1758047994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193990/movie_max.mp4?t=1758047994"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store